<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces used drones and CCTV to foil a terrorist attack in Riyom, while gunmen killed a traditional ruler and four vigilantes in Plateau and stormed a mining site, killing two people. In Zamfara, gunmen killed three police officers during a night patrol and three officers in a separate patrol attack. Islamic State claimed responsibility for a deadly attack on a military camp, and gunmen killed three policemen after attacking a night patrol team in Zamfara. The army chief visited Borno as parents of abducted children lamented 155 days in captivity, and 27 abducted victims, including a six-month-old infant, were rescued. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDc5aGstcVFvYWxpRlczSEVzOUtWWUxOY3hTWGZZTlBPZDRYcV8zMEJEVDM2cGJlUkc3YmNiYkFJdVFhdzNHUVBIOS1rbmkyUjZOTWo2Y2lhUVNJMUxDd0hUNmtTb3A1S3NOdTB0RHJXcGxiRUd4aU5lU3daUkdUeEx5bE42di0wYzJLMndsbVFwVjVTN21HdVZkOHplRi01bkVIN1BrMkJMSFozX250eWtB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNSk1mb0s4enlaV3RpM0xLYkY5WjFjQUNEbGQ4Qnc5Q1lRaE13MGJnUUFQNlc4QV9SbDQwLUJZNFlhcy1DWmZ2VGJ2SDUtaVFRQzd3UVIzNEo5YmZMWUt2Y25tWVMwcldSS1NEYjY0V01nWnJhYnc0YjY5YnMyLXJHTm9RSDZBbXkwZzA0TXBKNjhuRS0yTEhmZ0g2cmNWQk1XWm84V0ZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9iaTFvb3ZERThsd0tVUFlJbW9Dck5SbHBQdmxycDBad3RCUkVvSGJZZ1R6WHdZaVc3ZVBhcHVLbms2RXFjS1NJeWo4SURza29XOEpDZjhMRWVYWFRXZTdpTHhqMjc3ck51R1FGOFFqUE53WjRxNHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQaTNoRWRmNXFKUk16SHJOUnQ3SWJpT091UVBtNmdVRTJFN2J1b0ppYmRneW1XR0hFSTNlVGZDLXIwY3VaUGZKWGhuU3h5Z0cxSERQYUpLWWptRk80